    "render_note": "In the odds-scanner render JSON, calibrated_p_over.edge_vs_market carries the SIGNED EV (positive for over plays -> green OVER badge, negative for under plays -> red UNDER badge); the |value| is the EV. p_over is always the no-vig consensus P(over). The card meta (position field) shows 'book odds \u00b7 EV +X%' with the EV as a positive magnitude."
